# Environment for the web app (docs/deployment.md). Nothing here is secret.
# Copy to .env.local only if you need a different value; local development works without it.

# Online rooms server (Cloudflare Worker). Read at build time: change it, then rebuild.
#   Local development: leave unset → http://localhost:8080, served by `pnpm dev:server`.
#   Production / Vercel previews: set in the Vercel dashboard (Production + Preview), not here.
#   Note: the production server only accepts the Vercel site and its previews, not localhost.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GAME_SERVER_URL=https://chibi-bluff-server.nvhoa29702.workers.dev
